{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Sally and the Job Inquiry", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Quick Reply", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 15, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe complicated or unusual events in the past through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Requesting and Offering Help by E-mail  ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you contact someone asking for help by e-mail, it is important to be very polite. <br/><br/>Here are some common sentences and expressions that are considered polite in an e-mail.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Help\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Offering Help\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm not sure ... <br/>Do you think you could ... ?<br/>Could you tell me ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Don't you think ... ? <br/>I think it would be a good idea to ... <br/>Here are some tips ... <br/>I don't mind ... \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You can conclude an e-mail offering help with sentences like these:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>Thanks again for your e-mail. </li><li>Good luck with your new career!</li></ul></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Don't you think you could use that knowledge to help you start writing articles?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I think it would be a good idea to work as a freelancer to start.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Here are some tips when you are working online.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Subject and Object Relative Clauses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you want to make it clear which person or thing you are talking about, you use a relative clause.<br/><br/>You can begin a relative clause with the relative pronoun <span class=\"italic\">who</span> for people, <span class=\"italic\">which</span> for things or <span class=\"italic\">that</span> for either people or things.<br/><br/>In spoken English, you usually use <span class=\"italic\">that</span>, rather than <span class=\"italic\">which</span> or <span class=\"italic\">who</span>.<br/><br/>You put the relative clause immediately after the noun it talks about.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "A subject relative clause describes the subject of the clause.<br/>Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">The man who called wanted to speak to Tom.</span><br/>Which man? The man who called.<br/>The clause <span class=\"italic\">who called</span> immediately follows man - the noun it describes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "An object relative clause describes the object of the clause.<br/>Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Can you return the book that I lent you?</span><br/>Which book? The book I lent you.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Relative Pronoun</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Taking a journalism program, which is offered in many local colleges, would give you expert guidance from professionals working in the field. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"... which is offered in many local colleges ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">which</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You could even publish some of the stories that you write for your courses in <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Cambridge Life</span>!\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"... that you write for your courses ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">that</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It looks like you are a person who knows a lot about social media. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"... who knows a lot about social media.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">who</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "professional", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who works in professional fields, such as journalism or education", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You could get expert guidance from professionals working in the field. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when discussing jobs and work.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "guidance", "type": "name"}, {"content": "formal or professional help", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Guidance from working professionals would be very helpful. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "career", "type": "name"}, {"content": "area of work over a period of time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's true that journalism is a fascinating career.   ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to publish", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to reproduce a document, like an article or a story, for many people to read", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You could even publish some of your articles in \"Cambridge Life!\" ", "type": "example